  "instructions": [
    "In a large pan, heat 1 tablespoon of ghee over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the cumin seeds, coriander powder, turmeric powder, and red chili powder. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the lamb shoulder and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the yogurt and stir well to combine.",
    "Add 250ml of water and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 1 hour, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Stir in the raisins and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot over basmati rice or with naan bread."
